    <bpmn:process id="W_W5037" name="W5037. Storage Facility Design, Build-Out, Security &amp; Access Infrastructure" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Site secured (W5034); capacity plan (W5034); new build/remodel
Frequency: Per new site; ~5–10 sites/year
Volume: ~1 build-out per storage site
Owner: Director, Storage &amp; Rental Services / Facilities &amp; Construction (VS-20/VS-109)
Participants: Construction (VS-20/VS-109), Facilities (VS-138), Security/LP (VS-23/VS-159), HSE (VS-24), IT (VS-27), Real Estate (VS-97), BFP/fire consultant
Source: workflow W5037 — Storage Facility Design, Build-Out, Security &amp; Access Infrastructure</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5037_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5037_Lane1" name="Construction">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5037_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5037_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5037_Lane2" name="Security">
