    <bpmn:process id="W_W5038" name="W5038. Storage Lease/Rental Agreement, Terms &amp; Insurance Program Administration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program launch (W5033); legal/term refresh; regulatory change
Frequency: At launch + periodic review
Volume: 1 master lease template + ~1,000s of executed tenant leases at maturity
Owner: Director, Storage &amp; Rental Services / Legal (VS-100)
Participants: Legal (VS-100), Compliance (VS-22), Insurance (VS-26), Order-to-Cash (VS-16), Property Manager
Source: workflow W5038 — Storage Lease/Rental Agreement, Terms &amp; Insurance Program Administration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5038_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5038_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5038_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5038_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5038_Lane2" name="Insurance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5038_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5038_Lane3" name="Director Storage">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5038_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5038_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5038_Start5" name="Program launch (W5033); legal/term refresh; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5038_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5038_Task6" name="Draft the master lease/rental agreement: term (month-to-month vs fixed)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Draft the master lease/rental agreement: term (month-to-month vs fixed), rate/fee schedule, security deposit, late-fee/delinquency lien terms (links W5047), prohibited-goods clause (W5051), access rules, and the landlord-liability/no-bailment disclaimer (Civil Code)
Responsible (R): Legal / Director Storage / Compliance
Accountable (A): Director Storage / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: At launch + review</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5038_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5038_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5038_Task7" name="Set up the tenant insurance / damage-waiver program: mandatory tenant insurance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Set up the tenant insurance / damage-waiver program: mandatory tenant insurance or BuildRight-sold damage waiver, claim handling, and the data-privacy/consent on tenant data (RA 10173) with Insurance/Compliance (VS-26/VS-91)
Responsible (R): Insurance / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: At launch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5038_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5038_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5038_Task8" name="Operationalise lease administration: e-signature execution, lease master in the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Operationalise lease administration: e-signature execution, lease master in the storage PMS, auto-renewal, rate-change notice, and O2C/billing integration (VS-16)
Responsible (R): Director Storage / O2C / IT
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5038_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5038_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5038_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5038_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
