        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-752 (ensure controlled execution — Storage Portfolio Strategy, Site Selection &amp; Unit/Container Capacity Planning (PA-174.1).) | - CTL-752: master lease Legal-approved (VS-100); tenant data RA 10173-consented (VS-91); lien clause Civil-Code-compliant (W5047)
Owner: Director, Storage &amp; Rental Services / Legal (VS-100)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
