    <bpmn:process id="W_W5039" name="W5039. Storage Occupancy/Yield Management &amp; Dynamic Rate Optimization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Live program; monthly/weekly yield cycle; occupancy/vacancy movement
Frequency: Continuous + periodic rate review
Volume: ~all occupied units across ~50 sites × monthly cycles
Owner: Director, Storage &amp; Rental Services / Revenue/Yield Mgmt
Participants: Pricing (VS-01.2), FP&amp;A (VS-17.4), Property Manager, Analytics (VS-28), Marketing (VS-14)
Source: workflow W5039 — Storage Occupancy/Yield Management &amp; Dynamic Rate Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5039_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5039_Lane1" name="Yield Mgmt">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5039_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5039_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5039_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5039_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5039_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5039_Start3" name="Live program; monthly/weekly yield cycle; occupancy/vacancy movement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5039_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5039_Task4" name="Monitor occupancy &amp; demand by site/unit-type: physical vs economic occupancy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monitor occupancy &amp; demand by site/unit-type: physical vs economic occupancy, vacancy by size, lead-to-lease conversion, and seasonality (links W5055)
Responsible (R): Yield Mgmt / Analytics / Property Mgr
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Weekly/Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5039_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5039_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5039_Task5" name="Optimize rates dynamically: street-rate vs in-place-rate spread, move-in…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Optimize rates dynamically: street-rate vs in-place-rate spread, move-in discounts vs occupancy, and site-level rate adjustments that maximise revenue per available unit (RevPAU) — governed within the rate-card framework (W5035)
Responsible (R): Yield Mgmt / Pricing
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5039_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5039_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
