      <bpmn:userTask id="W5039_Task6" name="Act on churn &amp; delinquency: identify at-risk/move-out tenants, trigger…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Act on churn &amp; delinquency: identify at-risk/move-out tenants, trigger retention outreach (Marketing VS-14), and feed the delinquency workflow (W5044)
Responsible (R): Yield Mgmt / Property Mgr / O2C
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5039_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5039_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
