        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-752 (ensure controlled execution — Storage Portfolio Strategy, Site Selection &amp; Unit/Container Capacity Planning (PA-174.1).) | - CTL-752: rate changes within W5035 framework; discounts margin-controlled; churn/delinquency reconciled to O2C (VS-16)
Owner: Director, Storage &amp; Rental Services / Revenue/Yield Mgmt</bpmn:text>
