    <bpmn:process id="W_W5040" name="W5040. Storage Operator Partner, Franchise &amp; Third-Party-Manager Network Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy decision to partner/franchise (W5033); site where BuildRight won&#x27;t operate directly
Frequency: Continuous governance; ~5–15 partner sites at maturity
Volume: ~3–5 operator/franchise/third-party-manager relationships
Owner: Director, Storage &amp; Rental Services / Third-Party Risk (VS-161)
Participants: Legal (VS-100), Procurement (VS-03), Finance (VS-17.4), Compliance (VS-22), Brand/Marketing (VS-14), TPRM (VS-161)
Source: workflow W5040 — Storage Operator Partner, Franchise &amp; Third-Party-Manager Network Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5040_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5040_Lane1" name="Director Storage">
