      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5040_Start3" name="Strategy decision to partner/franchise (W5033); site where BuildRight won&#x27;t operate…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5040_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5040_Task4" name="Select &amp; onboard operators/franchisees/third-party managers: define the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Select &amp; onboard operators/franchisees/third-party managers: define the operating-standard &amp; brand-experience bar, screen (financial, operational, integrity — VS-161/W167), and contract the franchise/management agreement with Legal
Responsible (R): Director Storage / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): Director Storage / VP Legal &amp; Compliance
Duration: Per partner</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5040_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5040_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5040_Task5" name="Govern performance &amp; compliance: monitor operator occupancy/revenue/NOI vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govern performance &amp; compliance: monitor operator occupancy/revenue/NOI vs standard, customer-experience (VS-146), and regulatory/safety compliance (BFP/OSH/RA 10173), with audit rights
Responsible (R): Director Storage / Compliance / Internal Audit
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5040_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5040_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5040_Task6" name="Manage revenue share / royalty &amp; exit: revenue-share/royalty…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Manage revenue share / royalty &amp; exit: revenue-share/royalty billing/reconciliation (VS-16), dispute resolution, and the offboarding/transition path
Responsible (R): Director Storage / Finance / Legal
Accountable (A): Director Storage
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5040_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5040_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5040_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5040_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
