        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-752 (ensure controlled execution — Storage Portfolio Strategy, Site Selection &amp; Unit/Container Capacity Planning (PA-174.1).) | - CTL-752: operator vetting per VS-161/VS-167; audit rights in contract; royalty reconciled (VS-16)
Owner: Director, Storage &amp; Rental Services / Third-Party Risk (VS-161)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
